    "enUS": {
      "description": "I have placed the skull you provided alongside several bones I found while awaiting your return. Immediately I saw a sickly light spread from the skull and claim those old bones as its own. I see now why the call of necromancy is so hard to resist.\r\n\r\nDo you remember this crystal? It is draenethyst. I know little of its potential, but I believe it can channel Theradras' power. With it, perhaps you can dispel the curse.\r\n\r\nThe ritual site can be found by the pond just east of the village.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Uthek's Draenethyst Staff",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Dispel the Accursed Skull",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "{standing} / Honored Gelkis Clan Centaur",
          "type": "reputation"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and dispel the necromantic curse present on the Accursed Skull. Once successful, report back to Nerlokh near the Valley of Bones.",
      "title": "Test Your Theory",
